</span><span class=\"tr\">禪師</span><rt>chán shī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhuō zi\" data-defn=\"table / desk\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">桌子</span><span class=\"tr\">桌子</span><rt>zhuō zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng\" data-defn=\"(noun suffix) on; above\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fàng\" data-defn=\"to put / to place\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">放</span><span class=\"tr\">放</span><rt>fàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bēi zi\" data-defn=\"cup / glass\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">杯子</span><span class=\"tr\">杯子</span><rt>bēi zi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rán hòu\" data-defn=\"then; after that; afterwards\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yòng\" data-defn=\"to use; to make use of; to employ / (coverb) with; using\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuǐ hú\" data-defn=\"kettle / canteen